{"word":"κομίζω","uri":"komizô","senses":[{"word":"κομίζω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">κομίζω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">κομιῶ,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ao.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἐκόμισα,</span> <span class=\"ital\">pf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">κεκόμικα</span>)\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> prendre soin de,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> soigner avec\nsollicitude, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de vieillards, d’enfants,\netc. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">τινά,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">24, 541 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">15, 546,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> qqn ; <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span>\nnourrir, élever, <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">20, 68</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> introduire (dans la\nville) <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3,\n65</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. de choses,</span> donner des soins à, s’occuper activement\nde : <span class=\"grec\">τι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 490 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">21, 350 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">23, 355,</span> de qqe ch. ; <span class=\"grec\">δῶμα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">16, 74,</span> s’occuper des soins de la maison ;\n<span class=\"ital\">en ce sens, rare chez les Att.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ch.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">262, 344</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\nsuite :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> emporter pour mettre en\nlieu sûr, à l’abri : <span class=\"grec\">νεκρόν,</span>\n<spa